{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36767","headline":"送支使萧中丞赴阙 · 罗隐","name":"送支使萧中丞赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八年刀笔到京华，归去青冥路未赊。\n今日风流卿相客，旧时基业帝王家。\n彤庭彩凤虽添瑞，望府红莲已减花。\n从此常僚如有问，海边麇鹿斗边槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}